    · subst i; simp [y, lower]; omega

    · subst i; simp [y, lower]; omega

    · subst i; simp [y, lower]; omega

    · subst i; simp [y, lower]; omega

    · subst i; simp [y, lower]; omega

    · subst i; simp [y, lower]; omega

    · subst i; simp [y, lower]; omega

  have hcy := cover_shift originalForms [0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8] (by decide +kernel) w y lower hxy hc

  change Covers (values y fs_0) at hcy

  exact node_0 y (by simp [y, lower]; omega) hcy

